                <Text size={15} color="#94a3b8" lineHeight={1.55} maxW={820}>
                    Every stage of the v0.4.0 lifecycle -- built-in MCP server (8 native AI tools), semantic graph exploration, sub-100 us static checks, deterministic testing, Cranelift/VM benchmarks, headless --flow + multi-viewport visual audit, live GPU hot-reload, and native/WASM/web bundling -- ships in one binary. Active preset: {s.preset_name}.
